<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7476" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνασκευ-ή</span></b> , ἡ, opp.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατασκευή,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>pulling down: suppression</i>
			of desires, <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Epict.</u>
				4.1.175
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>refutation</i> of arguments, <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				6.4
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Quint.
				<u>Inst.</u>
				2.4.18
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hermog.
				<u>Prog.</u>
				5
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ κατ᾽ -ὴν τρόπος</span>
			<i>negative</i> mood, proof by <i>denial</i> or <i>argument
				from non-existence,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Sign.</u>
				31
			</span></i>, al.; <i>removal, cure,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυρετῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					3.137
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰσχιάδος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Archig.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				12.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>subversion,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πραγμάτων</span> Vett. Val.<i><span class="en">
				2.7
			</span></i>, al. (pl.).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
